{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>AiCulator 是一款專為 iPhone 設計的 AI 計算器，整合標準計算機、科學計算機、單位換算及 AI 數學解題功能，並運用 Apple Intelligence 提供逐步解答。無論是日常算術還是複雜數學問題，都能快速處理，適合學生、專業人士及任何需要可靠智能計算工具的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>內建操作流暢的標準計算機與科學計算機，並提供由 Apple Intelligence 驅動的 AI 數學解題功能，輸入任何數學問題即可取得逐步解答。另支援語音輸入、單位換算、計算記錄、主畫面小工具及多款主題，配合觸覺回饋與按鍵聲音，使用體驗更直觀。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-597-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-598-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-599-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-600-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-601-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-602-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AiCulator: Math Solver</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T12:38:52.442290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}